{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01FnwtosYfJa1kChwemXdyng","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Skill Foundry builds self-improving AI skills that learn from their own usage journals via a \"sleep loop\" — clustering and distilling candidate lessons, then gating them against the project's North Star and frozen canary evals before promoting versioned revisions with git rollback.\nThe North-Star gates enforce that a skill only ships a revision when it measurably improves, never regresses its frozen canary set, and never drifts toward a machine-checkable non-goal."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4284,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":24892,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce11df9c-55b6-466a-a71d-5986cab3b4b7","uuid":"953272c1-d06e-4c49-9bd2-a28a41a531b6","request_id":"req_011CcLjaHX2F4Ur8hw7kQE2V"}
